  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "のどぶくろを　ふくらませて　でんきをぞうふくさせる。　かぜに　のって１にちで　７００キロを　ひこうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목의 주머니를 부풀려서 전기를 증폭시킨다. 바람을 타고 하루에 700km를 비행할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會膨脹喉囊來增強電力。可以乘著風在１天內就飛上７００公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il gonfle son sac gulaire, l’intensité du courant électrique qu’il produit augmente. Il peut parcourir 700 km par jour en planant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon verstärkt seine Elektrizität durch Aufblasen des Kehlsacks. Es nutzt den Wind, um innerhalb eines Tages 700 km weit zu fliegen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aumenta la intensidad de su electricidad al inflar su saco gular. Es capaz de recorrer 700 km en un día impulsado por las corrientes de aire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gonfia la sacca nella gola per amplificare la sua energia elettrica. Quando vola sfrutta il vento, arrivando a percorrere 700 km in un giorno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kilowattrel inflates its throat sac to amplify its electricity. By riding the wind, this Pokémon can fly over 430 miles in a day.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "のど袋を　ふくらませて　電気を増幅させる。　風に　乗って１日で　７００キロを　飛行する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过膨胀喉囊来增强电力。乘着风可以在１天内就飞上７００公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aumenta la intensidad de su electricidad al inflar su saco gular. Es capaz de recorrer 700 km en un día impulsado por las corrientes de aire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "のどぶくろに　つばさで　つくった　でんきをためる。　はねの　ゆぶんが　とてもすくなく　およぎは　にがて。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목의 주머니에 날개로 만든 전기를 저장한다. 깃털에 유분이 매우 적어서 헤엄치는 것은 서툴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把翅膀製造的電儲存到喉囊裡。由於羽毛含的油脂少之又少，導致牠不是很擅長游泳。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il emmagasine l’électricité produite par ses ailes dans son sac gulaire. Il ne nage pas très bien, car ses plumes sont peu huilées.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit den Flügeln erzeugt es Strom, den es in seinem Kehlsack speichert. Da sein Gefieder kaum Öl enthält, kann es nicht gut schwimmen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Almacena la electricidad generada por sus alas en el saco gular. Su plumaje apenas contiene aceite, por lo que es un pésimo nadador.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Immagazzina nella sacca giugulare l’elettricità generata con le ali. Non avendo molto olio sulle piume, è un pessimo nuotatore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses its throat sac to store electricity generated by its wings. There’s hardly any oil in its feathers, so it is a poor swimmer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "のど袋に　翼で　作った　電気を溜める。　羽の　油分が　とても少なく　泳ぎは　苦手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会把翅膀制造的电储存到喉囊里。由于羽毛所含的油脂非常少，因此它不是很擅长游泳。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
